 lot of  football operations they're gonna figure  this out and they're going to be ready  to go but it will create more challenges  and I got no  problem with more time between pics what  else are we doing right I don't care  if the first round is a little bit  longer or rounds two and three take more  it's that's one of the reasons why  they're going through with this it's  giving those of us who are adhering to  the requirement to stay at home  something we can number one look forward  to and number two spend a lot of time  following and watching on TV  hi I'm Mike Tirico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from NBC  Sports

